```json
{
  "@nasa-jpl/stellar": "^2.0.0-alpha.30",
  "@nasa-jpl/stellar-svelte": "^2.0.0-alpha.64"
}
```

## Common Gotchas

1. Missing `?component` suffix on icon imports will cause build errors
2. CSS imports order matters - import base styles before component styles
3. Some components require explicit width/height settings
4. Remember to include both `@nasa-jpl/stellar` and `@nasa-jpl/stellar-svelte` packages

